<title>USA: G-III in licensing deal with Starter Corp.</title>
<headline>G-III in licensing deal with Starter Corp.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>G-III Apparel Group said Monday it signed a three-year licensing agreement with Starter Corp to design and produce a line of leather apparel and leather/textile combination outerwear.</p>
<p>G-III said the new product line, which will include leather varsity jackets and outerwear, is scheduled to launch this fall.  The agreement provides for a three-year renewal option.</p>
<p>G-III was not immediately available to provide financial information about the deal.</p>
</text>
